{
 "id": "shz02-vo-01",
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "items": [
  {
   "name": "L01",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "武松在景阳冈打死一只老虎，被人用轿子抬着，成了英雄。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L02",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "李逵在沂岭，一夜之间，杀了四只。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L03",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "可天亮以后，他连自己的名字都不敢说。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L04",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "因为那一夜，他不是去打虎的。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L05",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "这天，梁山摆酒，庆贺宋江把父亲接上了山。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L06",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "酒席散了，李逵忽然放声大哭："
  },
  {
   "name": "L07",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "这个也去取爷，那个也去望娘，偏铁牛是土掘坑里钻出来的！"
  },
  {
   "name": "L08",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他也有个老娘，在沂水县老家。他要接她上山，快活几天。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L09",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "宋江只许他独自去，不准喝酒，也不准带那两把板斧。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L10",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "半路上，一个劫道的被他一刀放倒。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L11",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "那人喊：家里还有个九十岁的老娘！"
  },
  {
   "name": "L12",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "杀人不眨眼的李逵，放了他，还给了十两银子。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L13",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "推开家门，娘坐在床上念佛，两只眼睛都瞎了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L14",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "娘说：我如常思量你，眼泪流干，因此瞎了双目。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L15",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "李逵不敢说实话。他说：铁牛做了官，来接娘。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L16",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他背起娘，趁着月色翻沂岭。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L17",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "半山上，娘渴得受不住。他把娘放在青石上，去找水。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L18",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "等他端着水回来——"
  },
  {
   "name": "L19",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "石头上，只剩他插下的那口刀。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L20",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "草地上有血，一路通到一个虎洞。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L21",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "李逵红了眼，提刀闯进去。小虎、母虎，一只都没放过。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L22",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "狂风里，又扑出一只吊睛白额虎。他迎上去，只一刀。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L23",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "天亮了。他用自己的布衫把娘包好，埋在山上，大哭了一场。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L24",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "下山时，猎户们不信：一个人，怎么杀得了四只虎？"
  },
  {
   "name": "L25",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "可他不敢说自己是谁：官府正悬赏三千贯，捉拿李逵。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L26",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他只说，自己叫张大胆。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L27",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "武松打一只虎，做了都头。"
  },
  {
   "name": "L28",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "李逵杀了四只，没了娘。"
  }
 ]
}